{"id":"57bd147368","t":"Doomsday for All: Me, Virus Monarch","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/jj-193x278.jpg","n":126,"l":128,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch"},"u":1795038223830,"desc":"وقع العالم في ظلام فوضى نهاية العالم. في هذا الواقع المظلم، أصبح العالم بأكمله حلبةً وحشيةً للتطو. إنها الفرصة والاختبار الأعظم للبشرية، كما أنها ملعبٌ للحكام والشياطين. مُنح تشين باي فرصةً ثانية، عائداً بالزمن لما قبل بداية كارثة نهاية العالم بعشرة أيام. بحقنٍ مباشرٍ لفيروس الزومبي، أيقظ موهبة من الرتبة SSS: ملك الفيروسات. والآن انطلق في رحلة تطورٍ مذهلة، متحكماً بالفيروس نفسه!","type":"manhua","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","خيال"],"src":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/1/"},"2":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/2/"},"3":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/3/"},"4":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/4/"},"5":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/5/"},"6":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/6/"},"7":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/7/"},"8":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/8/"},"9":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/9/"},"10":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/10/"},"11":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/11/"},"12":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/12/"},"13":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/13/"},"14":{"ml":"doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch|/manga/doomsday-for-all-me-virus-monarch/14